Package: com.rinapple.switzachwidgetprobe
Name: SwitzachWidgetProbe
Version: 1.0.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Home screen widgets for sideloaded apps on Switzach
 Puts the widgets of sideloaded apps on the Switzach home screen, the way iOS
 does: a widget gallery (+ button > Add Widget), small, medium and large sizes,
 stacks, removal with the − badge or the long-press menu, live updates,
 interactive buttons, and links that open the app at the right place.
 Actions that iOS performs inside the app open the app.
 .
 Crash guards stop a widget part that crashed instead of letting SpringBoard
 crash again; reset them in TweakSettings > SwitzachWidgetProbe.
Maintainer: rinapple
Author: rinapple
Homepage: https://github.com/Aquaappl/switzachwidgetprobe
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
